{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ3QWcmwwZPGUfHQzZ7v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Floor & Decor's (FND) comparable store sales, its name for same-store sales, fell **0.8%** in fiscal Q4 2024, the quarter ended 26 December 2024. That was growth of about –0.8%.\n\nI couldn't read the filing text directly, so this comes from exact-phrase searches:\n- **\"Comparable store sales decreased 0.8%\"** appears in only one filing: the Q4 and full-year 2024 earnings release (8-K, filed 20 Feb 2025). It does not appear in the FY2024 10-K, which only covers the full year. So 0.8% should be the Q4 figure.\n- **\"Comparable store sales decreased 7.1%\"** appears in both the earnings release and the 10-K, which points to it being the full-year 2024 figure.\n\nMatching 0.8% to Q4 is an inference from where each phrase does and doesn't appear. I didn't see the sentence in context.\n\n**Sources**\n- Form 8-K (Items 2.02/9.01, Exhibit 99 earnings release), filed 2025-02-20, accession 0001507079-25-000012\n- Form 10-K for fiscal year ended 2024-12-26, filed 2025-02-20, accession 0001507079-25-000013"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":754,"cache_read_input_tokens":8900,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":754},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e07c892-ae46-4f4f-b94d-cdc5e2fefaf9","uuid":"28836235-3b2b-45f2-8d21-22e7650b4b3b","timestamp":"2026-10-26T02:15:11.233Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ3QWEhjVgoRtWTLwC2r"}
